{
  "title": "Aromatic Charred Syrian Lentil Stew",
  "description": "A comforting and flavorful Syrian lentil stew with a charred twist, featuring cranberries and a velvety texture, perfect for a sick day. This plant-based friendly dish is whisked to perfection.",
