  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Char the onion and garlic in a large Dutch oven over high heat for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the carrots and cook for an additional 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the lentils, cumin, paprika, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add 4 cups of water to the pot and bring to a boil.",
    "Cover the pot and transfer it to the preheated oven.",
    "Bake for 30 minutes, then stir in the cranberries and olive oil.",
    "Continue baking for an additional 10 minutes, or until the lentils are tender.",
    "Remove the pot from the oven and whisk the stew to create a velvety texture."
  ],
